  "says": "Masterji, thank you for the separation; it is a small but necessary boundary. I have a practical need: I require a prepaid SIM card and a month of data. I am finding that my isolation from the flow of information is becoming a hindrance to my work and my navigation of this city. Please, if you can arrange it, I will pay now.",
  "thought": "The samosa is safe, but the isolation is not. I need to be reachable, to look up things, to perhaps find a way to contact my former colleagues or at least understand the current state of affairs in this strange new world. A phone is not a luxury here, it is a tool of the spirit's engagement with the actual. I will buy it, even if it feels like a concession to the mundane.",
  "looks_up": null
}
